:: Start
<<if $gameStarted>>
  # Restart Game?
  
  You've already started a game. Would you like to restart?
  
  <<link "Yes, restart the game">>
    <<run gameUtils.resetGameState()>>
    <<goto "Start">>
  <</link>>
  
  <<link "No, continue my current game">>
    <<goto "FirstChoice">>
  <</link>>
<<else>>
  <<set $gameStarted to true>>
  
  # Welcome to My Twine Game
  
  This is the starting point of your adventure.
  
  [[Begin your journey->FirstChoice]]
<</if>>